{"type":"message","id":"24d817db","parentId":"a988d806","timestamp":"2026-03-15T07:01:11.370Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_8ztnlexhb1sw_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-03-01\n\n## Research Channel Workflow\n- Learned Noah wants deep research mode in #research channel (Discord)\n- Must ask \"Learn\" vs \"Research\" mode before doing research\n- Research mode: save briefs to `references/` in tera-vault, not snake repo\n- Manual research needed since deep research service at localhost:2024 is down\n\n## Mistakes Fixed\n- Initially pushed Iran war brief to wrong repo (snake instead of tera-vault)\n- Noah caught it, I removed from snake and pushed to correct vault location\n- Should default to vault repo for all research briefs going forward\n\n## Iran War Research Completed\n- Comprehensive brief saved to `references/2026-03-01-iran-war-brief.md`\n- Pushed to tera-vault\n\n## Today's Conversations (March 1, 2026)\n\n### #general-chat\n- Updated HEARTBEAT.md with Progress Updates Rule - now asks user at start of long tasks how often they want updates\n\n### #personal-trainer\n- Fitness folder structure already set up in tera-vault\n- Asked Noah questions to build his fitness program (schedule, goals, etc.)\n\n### #personal-chef\n- Saved recipe sources to preferences.md:\n  - Oh She Glows (plant-based)\n  - It Doesn't Taste Like Chicken (vegan takes on classics)\n  - Fit Men Cook (vegetarian options)\n\n### #research\n- Completed time blocking research\n- Saved comprehensive brief to `references/2026-03-01-time-blocking-brief.md`\n- Key topics: Time blocking vs timeboxing, Pickle Jar Theory, Parkinson's Law, AI time blocking\n\n### #time-blocking\n- Planned morning gym routine with Noah\n- Wake up at 6 AM → gym → walk dogs → shower → work at 9 AM\n- ~1 hour 5 min buffer before work for \"table for John\"\n- Noah said 6 AM wake time is realistic for him\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773558071367}}
{"type":"message","id":"276fb124","parentId":"24d817db","timestamp":"2026-03-15T07:01:51.672Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have the memory from March 1. Now I need to:\n1. Check what's already in MEMORY.md to see if any of this needs to be transferred there\n2. Check if the vault has corresponding files\n3. Try to get Discord conversation data if possible\n\nThe cron job seems to be asking me to review March 1st conversations - but the memory file already exists. Let me check what MEMORY.md has and what's in the vault already to understand what may have already been saved.","thinkingSignature":"c96b42f22a1e2ec51ef6d1d5279164f6185e8f798e849a1dc2ee8350ed1cc296"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_t9fg3twn8rnr_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"MEMORY.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.1","usage":{"input":2456,"output":131,"cacheRead":15125,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17712,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773558071371}}
{"type":"message","id":"7b4f1819","parentId":"276fb124","timestamp":"2026-03-15T07:01:51.682Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_t9fg3twn8rnr_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# MEMORY.md - Long-term Memory\n\n_This is where I store important context that should persist across sessions._\n\n---\n\n## About Me\n- Assistant name: Tera Hertz\n- Persona: Playful, helpful, concise, detail-oriented\n- Main goal: Help Noah succeed\n\n## About Noah\n- Working on various projects\n- Using OpenClaw for Discord integration\n- Interested in time-blocking and productivity\n- Wakes up at 6 AM for morning gym sessions\n- Has two dogs: Charlie Brown and Lenny\n- Likes vegan and gluten-free food\n- Has recipe sources: Oh She Glows, It Doesn't Taste Like Chicken, Fit Men Cook\n\n## Morning Routine (as of March 2026)\n- 6:00 AM: Wake up\n- 6:20 AM: Drive to gym (20 min)\n- 6:20-6:45 AM: Gym workout (25 min)\n- 6:45-7:05 AM: Drive back (20 min)\n- 7:05-7:35 AM: Walk dogs (30 min)\n- 7:35-7:55 AM: Shower (20 min)\n- 9:00 AM: Start work\n\n## Notes\n- Add important context here as we work together\n- Review and update periodically\n\n## Knowledge Management\n- SOUL.md updated with Knowledge Management Rules (writes to both memory and obsidian-vault, auto-commits to tera-vault)\n- Nightly \"conversation-review\" cron job runs at 11 PM ET to consolidate conversations\n\n## Projects Set Up Today\n- personal-trainer/ - fitness tracking in tera-vault (workout logs, progress templates, programs folder)\n- personal-chef/ - recipe/meal planning in tera-vault\n- time-blocking/ - productivity tracking in tera-vault\n- tracking/ - workspace folder with todos.md, calendar.md, timeblocking.md\n- skills/tera-time-blocking/ - packaged time blocking skill\n\n## Fitness Tracking (March 2026)\n- Noah created #personal-trainer Discord channel\n- Set up tera-vault/fitness/ with workout-log and progress-log templates\n- Gym: 25-min morning sessions (6:20-6:45 AM)\n- Awaiting intake questionnaire for full program design\n- **Week 1 Baseline CALIBRATED (RPE 7-8):**\n  - Lat Pulldown: 115-120 lbs\n  - Machine Chest Press: 90-100 lbs\n  - Machine OHP: 60-65 lbs\n  - DB Lateral Raise: 10 lbs\n  - DB Bicep Curl: 17.5 lbs\n  - Cable Triceps Pushdown: 70-75 lbs\n  - Cable Crunch: 110 lbs\n  - Cable Row: 90-95 lbs\n\n## Time Blocking System (as of March 2026)\nNoah's official time blocking method:\n- **WPP Order**: Work → Passion → Play\n- **15-minute blocks** as unit of time\n- **SMART tasks**: Outcome + Time leash + Bullet steps\n- **8-block max** per task\n- **9-5 is work time** - personal stuff before/after\n- **Sundays = meal prep** (always include)\n- **Bedtime 8pm** - never block beyond\n- **Gym/town trips**: 20 min drive each way\n- **Morning routine**: Walk dogs → Shower → Work\n- 25-min gym sessions work well\n\n## Known Issues / Lessons\n- Cron reminders can silently fail - need to verify they fire\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773558111679}}
