{"type":"message","id":"feace6f4","parentId":"ede6dfaa","timestamp":"2026-03-15T07:03:06.761Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_itsj5c0jk8f1_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-03-01\n\n## Research Channel Workflow\n- Learned Noah wants deep research mode in #research channel (Discord)\n- Must ask \"Learn\" vs \"Research\" mode before doing research\n- Research mode: save briefs to `references/` in tera-vault, not snake repo\n- Manual research needed since deep research service at localhost:2024 is down\n\n## Mistakes Fixed\n- Initially pushed Iran war brief to wrong repo (snake instead of tera-vault)\n- Noah caught it, I removed from snake and pushed to correct vault location\n- Should default to vault repo for all research briefs going forward\n\n## Iran War Research Completed\n- Comprehensive brief saved to `references/2026-03-01-iran-war-brief.md`\n- Pushed to tera-vault\n\n## Today's Conversations (March 1, 2026)\n\n### #general-chat\n- Updated HEARTBEAT.md with Progress Updates Rule - now asks user at start of long tasks how often they want updates\n\n### #personal-trainer\n- Fitness folder structure already set up in tera-vault\n- Asked Noah questions to build his fitness program (schedule, goals, etc.)\n\n### #personal-chef\n- Saved recipe sources to preferences.md:\n  - Oh She Glows (plant-based)\n  - It Doesn't Taste Like Chicken (vegan takes on classics)\n  - Fit Men Cook (vegetarian options)\n\n### #research\n- Completed time blocking research\n- Saved comprehensive brief to `references/2026-03-01-time-blocking-brief.md`\n- Key topics: Time blocking vs timeboxing, Pickle Jar Theory, Parkinson's Law, AI time blocking\n\n### #time-blocking\n- Planned morning gym routine with Noah\n- Wake up at 6 AM → gym → walk dogs → shower → work at 9 AM\n- ~1 hour 5 min buffer before work for \"table for John\"\n- Noah said 6 AM wake time is realistic for him\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773558186760}}
